cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you refer to this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Ad Fast-Forward for YouTube
abstract: >-
  A Chrome extension that mutes YouTube video ads, blacks them out and plays them at 16x,
  and pauses long ads once so the user can press Skip. It needs no permissions and has no
  build step.
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Jaeyun
    alias: freezinghands
repository-code: https://github.com/freezinghands/youtube-ad-fast-forward
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - youtube
  - youtube-ads
  - chrome-extension
  - browser-extension
  - manifest-v3
